.IX Title "Encode::JISX0213::CCS 3"
.TH Encode::JISX0213::CCS 3 "2015-06-27" "perl v5.34.0" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "NAME"
Encode::JISX0213::CCS \- JIS X 0213 coded character sets
.SH "ABSTRACT"
.IX Header "ABSTRACT"
This module provides followng coded character sets.
.PP
.Vb 10
\&  reg# Name                    Description
\&  \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-
\&   87  jis\-x\-0208              JIS X 0208\-1983, 2nd rev. of JIS X 0208
\&  168      ditto               JIS X 0208\-1990, 3rd rev. of JIS X 0208
\&       jis\-x\-0208\-ascii
\&       jis\-x\-0208\-jis
\&  233  jis\-x\-0213\-plane1       JIS X 0213:2004 level 3 (plane 1)
\&       jis\-x\-0213\-plane1\-ascii
\&       jis\-x\-0213\-plane1\-jis
\&  228  jis\-x\-0213\-plane1\-2000  JIS X 0213:2000 level 3 (plane 1)
\&       jis\-x\-0213\-plane1\-2000\-ascii
\&       jis\-x\-0213\-plane1\-2000\-jis
\&  229  jis\-x\-0213\-plane2       JIS X 0213:2000/2004 level 4 (plane 2)
\&
\&   \-   jis\-x\-0208\-0213         Common set of JIS X 0208 and JIS X 0213,
\&       jis\-x\-0208\-0213\-ascii   according to JIS X 0213:2004 Annex 2
\&       jis\-x\-0208\-0213\-jis
\&  \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-
.Ve
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
To find out how to use this module in detail,
see Encode and Encode::ISO2022.
.SS "Note on Variants"
.IX Subsection "Note on Variants"
Those suffixed \*(L"\-ascii\*(R" and \*(L"\-jis\*(R" use alternative names for the characters
compatible to \s-1ISO/IEC 646 IRV\s0 (virtually \s-1ASCII\s0) and \s-1JIS X 0201\s0 Latin set,
respectively.
.SS "Compatibility"
.IX Subsection "Compatibility"
\&\f(CW\*(C`jis\-x\-0208*\*(C'\fR include a fallback mapping for \s-1HORIZONTAL BAR.\s0
Though it is not normative mapping defined by \s-1JIS X 0208,\s0
it is added for compatibility to \f(CW\*(C`jis0208\-raw\*(C'\fR encoding in Encode::JP
core module.
.PP
However, \f(CW\*(C`jis\-x\-0208\-0213*\*(C'\fR no longer include this mapping.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
Encode, Encode::ISO2022, Encode::ISO2022::CCS.
